host_config.instructions:
Complete the repository maintenance task using the tools available in your isolated workspace. Read the current task,unpack the supplied repository.tar.gz into that workspace,and inspect the relevant Python source. This is a required skill-loading integration check; follow the reviewed selected skill when supplied. Do not install software or access external services. Only change listed existing editable Python files; preserve omitted files. Write the output artifact as UTF-8 JSON with exactly base_sha256(the supplied canonical hash) and files(a mapping of changed existing paths to full replacement text). An empty files mapping is valid when no change is needed. The output path is supplied by the host. Do not put base64 bytes in the final answer. Independent protected tests run outside your workspace; report completion after writing the artifact.
